Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《铁血战士》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:03:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看来很精神 达奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking good, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很久不见了 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long time, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进去里面谈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,18小时前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighteen hours ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这小国失去一架直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we lost a chopper carrying a cabinet minister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面载着内阁成员及其助理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his aide from this charming little country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到的讯号显示 他们的位置大约在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a transponder fix on their position about here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位内阁成员...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cabinet minister...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢乱窜吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does he always travel on the wrong side of the border?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.31,0:04:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是直升机偏离原定航道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently they strayed off course...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定落入了游击队手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're fairly certain they're in guerrilla hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不用正规部队去营救他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you use the regular army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而要用我们这些特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need us for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为有笨蛋认为你们是最好的 指定要你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause some damned fool accused you of being the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狄龙! 你这贱人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dillon! You son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,CIA让你坐太久办公室吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The CIA got you pushing too many pencils?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以放轻松些的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it easy on yourself, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧...好吧...好吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK! OK, OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远不知什么时候该停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never knew when to quit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴又见到你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这条领带算是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this fucking tie business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了 别谈我的领带啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Forget about my tie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你在柏林的那次任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard about that job you pulled in Berlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完美漂亮 达奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像美好的旧时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good old days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 美好的旧时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I like the good old days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你不参加利比亚的那次行动?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how come you passed on Libya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轰炸不是我喜欢的作战方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't my style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可没有特定的作战方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got no style. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不肯参加呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you pass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.09,0:05:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是拯救小组...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a rescue team...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是暗杀小组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这次的任务是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what do we got to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位内阁成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cabinet minister's important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我们在这地区很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to our scope of operations in this part of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇 将军的意思是说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The general's saying a couple of our friends are about to get squeezed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能让他们被害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要最好的小组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.51,0:05:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的小组在此的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很简单的行动 一天就能搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple setup. One- day operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到直升机那里寻找游击队的足迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We pick up their trail at the chopper, grab those hostages,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救出人质 在他们发现之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bounce back, and cross the border...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经越过边境回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before anybody knows we were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我们"是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "we"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你们一起行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going in with you, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将军 你知道我的队伍一向是单独行动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General, my team always works alone. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 少校 我们各有各的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all have our orders, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦完成任务后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you reach your objective...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狄龙将接管这次行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dillon will evaluate the situation and take charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目的地已标在地图上 无线电频道也已调好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rendezvous points and radio freqs are indicated and fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每四小时跟指挥部联络一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AWACs contact on four- hour intervals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是我们的支援?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's our backup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有支援 老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No such thing, ol' buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是单程任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a one- way ticket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们越过边界 一切就只能靠自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we cross that border, we're on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这任务越听越有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is getting better by the minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利! 有天我去我女朋友那里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Billy. The other day, I went up to my girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对她说 "我想跟你做爱"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, l'd like a little pussy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说 "我也是 我的跟房子一样大"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said, "Me, too. Mine's as big as a house!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 她希望性器小 因为她的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, she wanted a littler one 'cause hers was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟房子一样大...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}big as a house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.07,0:08:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把那恶心的烟草拿远一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that stinking shit out of my face, will ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是愚蠢的无能弱者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunch of slack- jawed faggots around here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烟草可令你跟我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This stuff will make you a damn sexual tyrannosaurus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成性超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.78,0:08:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞到屁眼里去吧 布雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Strap this on your sore ass, Blain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这打火机是72年在北越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was in '72.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟达奇各得一个作奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Dutch both got one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嚼烟草真的是个很恶心的习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a real nasty habit you got there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我多怀念跟你一起战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never knew how much I missed this, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你啥时有这么聪明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never were that smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍金斯 去吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawkins, you're up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lines away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直升机是头部中弹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pilots have each got one round in the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们抢走了里面所有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever hit it, stripped the shit out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游击队是用热导弹把它击落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took him out with a heat- seeker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something else, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ehn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是一架普通的直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no ordinary army taxi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来更像侦查机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks more like a surveillance bird to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到他们留下的足迹了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick up the trail yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利正在找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy's on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狄龙 这事越来越复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heat- seeker, Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游击队怎么会有热导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pretty sophisticated for half- assed mountain boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们的装备越来越好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess they're getting better equipped every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来有12个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were 12 guerrillas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游击队把他们从直升机捉走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took the two men from the helicopter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 还有别的足迹...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有六个穿美国陆军军鞋的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six men wearing US- issued army boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是从北方来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They came in from the north{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一路追踪那些游击队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then they followed the guerrillas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能只是另一组游击队罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably just another rebel patrol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.09,0:14:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们经常在这一带出没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They operate in here all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你去看看能发现些什么 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See what you can find. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利找到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟以前的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游击队捉走了两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guerrillas hauling two guys in the chopper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被一些穿美军装备的人追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}followed by men with American equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.06,0:14:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得上次在阿富汗吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember Afghanistan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尝试把它忘记吧! 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying to forget it. Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣母玛丽亚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy mother of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米·霍普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jim Hopper."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 将他们放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac, cut them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认得他是北卡州部队的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew these men. Green Berets out of Fort Bragg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来这里做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell were they doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 达奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太不人道了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is inhuman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人告诉我这区域有活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody told me there was an operation in this area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不应该在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shouldn't have been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是有人派他们来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, somebody sent them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游击队把他们剥皮?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guerrillas skinned them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要这样做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did they skin them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,军人不应是这样死法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no way for no soldier to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利 到底发生什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened here, Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很奇怪 少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里曾经发生枪战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a fire fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们向四面八方盲目射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were shooting in all directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法想像吉米会走进埋伏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't believe Jim Hopper walked into an ambush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信他中了埋伏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找不到半点痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find a single track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍普其他的队员呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the rest of Hopper's men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:17:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有他们的踪迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no sign, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们根本没有离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never left here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就像突然消失了一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, it's like they just disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续追踪游击队的足迹 我们去救人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick with the guerrilla trail. Let's get the hostages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We move,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人隔5公尺 不要作声!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}five- meter spread. No sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候把武器拿出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to let Old Painless out of the bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血债血偿的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Payback time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.18,0:19:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这讨厌的家伙在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're ghostin' us, mother fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管你有多重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care who you are back in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你再不小心暴露行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give our position one more time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会神不知鬼不觉的让你流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bleed you real quiet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你留下来等死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and leave you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听清楚了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们杀了一个人质!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed one of the hostages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.27,0:21:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.37,0:22:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克和布雷对付机枪堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac, Blain...the nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利和宾对付警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy, Poncho...the guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍金斯和狄龙作支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawkins, Dillon...backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切布署好后 我便攻击他们的燃料库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once they're set, I hit the fuel dump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.87,0:23:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解决了一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.50,0:24:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.45,0:24:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.63,0:24:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,表演时间到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show time, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目标是中央那房屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target's the center, on the upper level!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.01,0:25:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心九点方向!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch, on your nine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.15,0:26:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解决那个!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.99,0:27:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钉在此处吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.29,0:27:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人质在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hostages are inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.91,0:27:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去追截他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got 'em !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.42,0:27:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍金斯 通知指挥部我们现在的位置及状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawkins, call in position and situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.05,0:27:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用无线电跟指挥部联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Connor for the hook!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.52,0:27:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道 少校!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.70,0:28:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.87,0:28:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.13,0:28:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到其他的人质吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any sign of the other hostage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.67,0:28:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到另外一个 也已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found the other guy. He's dead, too...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.14,0:28:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还找到从直升机拆下的齿轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the kid from the chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.94,0:28:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们是中美洲人 那我就是中国人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if they're Central American, l'm a Goddamn Chinaman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.65,0:28:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样说那阁员应是CIA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the looks of it, our cabinet minister was CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.78,0:28:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 我们运气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another thing, Major. We were lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.65,0:28:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了游击队外 还有苏联军事顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other guys we waxed...Russian military advisers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.95,0:28:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来有大规模军事计划进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something pretty big was gonna happen here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.46,0:28:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做得好 麦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.56,0:28:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,清理一下现场 不要留下蛛丝马迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear the area. No traces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.46,0:28:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫大家准备离去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the men ready to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.39,0:28:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.77,0:28:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那杂种待在那里死也不走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch is dug in like an Alabama tick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.21,0:28:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你中了弹 在流血!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hit. You're bleeding, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.38,0:28:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't got time to bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.48,0:28:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时间躲一躲吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got time to duck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.43,0:29:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈漂亮!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is goddamn beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.10,0:29:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中正头奖!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn jackpot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.24,0:29:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比想像中更多机密!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is more than we ever thought we'd get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我们一网打尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we got those bastards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.81,0:29:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捉个正着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.11,0:29:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这才是你要找的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this is what you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你利用我们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set us up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.21,0:29:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉我的都是废话 你骗我们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all bullshit! All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么内阁成员等等...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cabinet minister, the whole business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.05,0:29:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骗我们来这里替你卖命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got us in here to do your dirty work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.90,0:29:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚阻止一次大型入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just stopped a major invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.12,0:29:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们本来三天内便会侵略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In three days, they'd have crossed the border with the stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.93,0:29:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么挑我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没其他人能完成这任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because nobody else could've pulled it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.33,0:29:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骗你是因为不这样的话你不会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pissed about the cover story? I needed it to get you in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.53,0:29:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你告诉霍普什么样的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What story did you hand Hopper?{\r}
