Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.69,0:44:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.01,0:44:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说这丛林活过来抓走了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says the jungle...it just came alive and took him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.81,0:44:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放屁! 她不是这样说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit! That's not what she said!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.35,0:44:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说的完全没有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What she said doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.15,0:44:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游击队一直在追我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those sappers followed us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.42,0:44:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乱说 他们在我们前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, they've been ahead of us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.25,0:44:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这女人想赶到前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This woman's been running us right to 'em !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.22,0:44:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别吵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.62,0:44:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.56,0:44:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么没拿走他的 无线电或是武器?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't they take his radio or his weapon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.03,0:44:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么没逃走?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't she escape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.13,0:44:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍普!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.33,0:44:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.17,0:44:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们像对付霍普一样对霍金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did the same thing to Jim Hopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.44,0:44:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搜寻霍金斯的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want Hawkins' body found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.55,0:44:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扫荡搜索队形!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweep pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.75,0:44:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往我们来的方向搜索 检查这50公尺的范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double back. 50 meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.55,0:45:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.46,0:46:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 你们这些杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in, you fuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.30,0:46:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.00,0:46:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的武器在等待你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old Painless is waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.90,0:47:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接触敌人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.73,0:48:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 王八蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother fucker! Fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.25,0:48:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的! 你这杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother fucker! You mother fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.90,0:49:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.73,0:49:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.10,0:49:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.73,0:49:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.95,0:49:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布雷 身上没有火药痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blain. No powder burns,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.72,0:49:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no shrapnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.63,0:49:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的伤口是烧焦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wound's all fused, cauterized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.93,0:49:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西会造成这样的伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell could have done this to a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.57,0:49:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克! 麦克 看着我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac. Mac, look at me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.54,0:49:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁做的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who did this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.44,0:49:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, goddamn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.14,0:49:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到一些...一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw s- something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.75,0:49:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.98,0:49:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点痕迹也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not a fucking trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.55,0:50:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有血迹...没有尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No blood, no bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.35,0:50:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么也没打到!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hit nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.46,0:50:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狄龙 你最好快跟总部联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dillon...better get on the radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.90,0:50:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.50,0:50:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,士官!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.67,0:50:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.40,0:50:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在山脊上布置个防御阵地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a defensive position above that ridge...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.27,0:50:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把所有爆炸品都准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mined with everything we've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.08,0:50:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他放好 我们带他一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him in his poncho. Take him with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.48,0:50:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来办!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.70,0:50:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vamonos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.38,0:51:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少校 我已经装设好照明弹 手榴弹及地雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major...I set up flares, frags, and CIAymores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.45,0:51:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有什么能不碰到这些东西 进到这阵地来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's coming near this place without tripping on something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.38,0:51:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 士官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sergeant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.86,0:51:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.79,0:51:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a good soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.96,0:51:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是...我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was, um...my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.23,0:53:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 我的兄弟!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good- bye, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.23,0:54:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火焰一号 我重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blazer one, I repeat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.04,0:54:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须把我们撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}extraction necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.64,0:54:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍 火焰一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say again, Blazer one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.87,0:54:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.64,0:54:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的要求不被接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Request for extraction denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.88,0:54:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的位置仍旧暴露在敌人的火力网下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Area is still compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.65,0:54:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请前进到3000位置 我们在那里接你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed to sector 3,000 for prisoner extraction. Priority, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.55,0:54:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次联络时间是9:30\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next contact 0930.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.38,0:54:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 火焰一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, Blazer one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.19,0:54:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,10:30联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10:30 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.75,0:54:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn bastards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.86,0:54:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说我们的位置还太远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say we're still in too far,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.26,0:54:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能冒险前来接我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they can't risk coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.26,0:54:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是资产 狄龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're assets, Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.06,0:54:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以牺牲的资产!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expendable assets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.76,0:54:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,CIA就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It comes with the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.46,0:54:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这点我可以接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.37,0:54:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡说 你跟我们一样生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit. You're just like the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.07,0:54:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直升机不会来这里就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shitload of good a chopper's gonna do us in here anyhow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.91,0:54:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,士官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.18,0:55:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,士官! 士官!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant! Sergeant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.28,0:55:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天谁攻击我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who hit us today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.38,0:55:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.29,0:55:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只看到一个有伪装的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only saw one of them camouflaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.09,0:55:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.39,0:55:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那对眼睛...忽然消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those eyes disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.73,0:55:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.73,0:55:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那对眼睛 他们...他们消失不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those eyes, they...they disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.63,0:55:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道一件事 少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know one thing, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.30,0:55:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对准向它射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drew down and fired straight at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.94,0:55:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我射了200轮以上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capped off 200 rounds in the minigun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.31,0:55:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把所有子弹射光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.21,0:55:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是一点用处也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.01,0:55:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这世上没有什么东西 在那个范围内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing on this earth could have lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.41,0:55:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还能生存的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at that range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.22,0:55:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 你站第一班 然后去休息一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac, you take first watch then you get some rest, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.06,0:55:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问她看到什么? 问她霍金斯怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask her what she saw. Ask her what happened to Hawkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.56,0:55:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问她吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, ask her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.29,0:55:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.91,0:55:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.39,0:56:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丛林活过来把他抓走
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.68,0:56:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是那句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same fucking thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.18,0:56:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丛林活过来把他抓走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The jungle, it came alive and took him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.85,0:56:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利 你一定知道些什么 到底是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy, you know something. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.38,0:56:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感到害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm scared, Poncho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.29,0:56:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放屁! 你不怕任何人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit. You ain't afraid of no man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.96,0:56:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面有东西在等我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something out there waiting for us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.09,0:56:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且并不是人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it ain't no man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.77,0:56:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们全都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.51,0:56:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙已经失去理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man's losing it. He's losing his cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.68,0:56:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是有些敌人在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing but a couple guys running around...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.88,0:56:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以应付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we gotta take 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.51,0:56:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是不明白 狄龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still don't understand, Dillon, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.62,0:56:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is out there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.39,0:56:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它杀了霍普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it killed Hopper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.49,0:56:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在它要杀死我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now it wants us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.20,0:56:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又在一起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are again, bro...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.23,0:57:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.70,0:57:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一样的月亮 一样的丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same kind of moon, same kind of jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.04,0:57:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那晚我们喝酒来壮胆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real number- ten night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.11,0:57:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.74,0:57:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whole platoon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.44,0:57:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,32个人都被剁成肉酱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}32 men chopped into meat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.91,0:57:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we walk out, just you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.31,0:57:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再没有别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.02,0:57:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是最好的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right on top of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.42,0:57:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这根本不算一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a scratch. Not a fucking scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.05,0:57:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道不管是谁把你杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, whoever got you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.86,0:57:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会回来找我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll come back again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.32,0:57:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要他敢回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when he does...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.13,0:57:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你的名字刻在他身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to cut your name into him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.48,0:57:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.55,0:57:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.96,0:57:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.71,0:57:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在那里 麦克? - 在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you? - Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.23,0:58:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.96,0:58:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.06,0:58:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克! 该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac! Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.37,0:58:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 你在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.48,0:58:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.18,0:58:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捉逮到你了 贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you, mother fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.22,0:58:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我杀死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed you, you fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.29,0:58:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 你杀了一只猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, you killed a pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.03,0:58:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是应该找只大点的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you could have found something bigger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.20,0:58:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 去你妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you, Poncho. Fuck you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.53,0:58:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那女人在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.50,0:58:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.61,0:58:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没人看着她?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell wasn't anybody watching her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.41,0:58:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么没有逃走?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't she try to get away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.01,0:58:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看她 她吓坏了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at her. She's scared out of her mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.72,0:59:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少校 你最好来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major, you better take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.46,0:59:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布雷的尸体不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blain's body, it's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.66,0:59:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它避过了我们设下的陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came in through the tripwires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.06,0:59:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们面前把布雷带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took it right out from under our noses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.45,0:59:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那只猪误触陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That boar had to set off a tripflare...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.65,0:59:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再没有其它足印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because there ain't no other tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.65,0:59:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么有人能通过陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could anyone get through this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.65,0:59:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带走布雷又不让我们发觉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and carry out Blain without us knowing it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.06,0:59:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是指他为什么没杀人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't he try and kill one of us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.86,0:59:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来只是拿那尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came to get the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.46,0:59:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一次只杀一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's killing us one at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.00,0:59:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像猎人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.98,1:00:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是利用这些树潜进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's using the trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.00,1:00:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天你看到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yesterday, what did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.80,1:00:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在浪费你的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wasting your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.60,1:00:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再跟我们玩把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.31,1:00:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道它是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what it was. It...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.01,1:00:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.21,1:00:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它会变颜色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It changed colors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.15,1:00:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像变色龙一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the chameleon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.65,1:00:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它利用这丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It uses the jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.12,1:00:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说他们是被蜥蜴杀死的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blain and Hawkins were killed by a lizard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.46,1:00:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发什么神经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a bullshit psych job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.62,1:00:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面最多只有两三人在活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's 2 or 3 men out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.56,1:00:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去他妈的蜥蜴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking lizard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.13,1:00:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.03,1:00:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.54,1:01:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.07,1:01:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这东西在追捕我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the thing is hunting us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.57,1:01:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.44,1:01:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.35,1:01:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.98,1:01:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要这里的每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.05,1:01:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带她回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm taking her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.75,1:01:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们五分钟后就要走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We leave in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.15,1:01:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还不能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.26,1:01:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 救援部队很快便到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rendezvous is ten miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.26,1:01:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为直升机会等我们吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think the chopper's going to wait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.76,1:01:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狄龙 我们必须共同抵抗敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make a stand now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.36,1:01:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则谁都不能活着出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or nobody will be left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.96,1:01:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.27,1:01:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个大个子被杀的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the big man was killed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.87,1:01:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定弄伤了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must have wounded it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.10,1:01:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的血滴在树叶上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its blood was on the leaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.91,1:01:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它会流血 那么我们就能杀掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it bleeds, we can kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.57,1:02:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.53,1:02:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为这童子军玩意有效?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think this Boy Scout bullshit's gonna work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.13,1:02:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它能看到那些金属线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can see tripwires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.96,1:02:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但可能看不到这陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it can't see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.17,1:02:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少废话了 赶紧帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead of complaining, maybe you should help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.90,1:03:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么你认为它一定会走这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think he'll come through here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.20,1:03:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,50码半径内的每棵树上 都绑上了金属线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trees have tripwires every 50 yards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.80,1:03:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是剩下的唯一通路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the only way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.36,1:04:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我还是小孩子时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was little,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.33,1:04:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到一个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we found a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.96,1:04:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他看起来像被屠宰过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looked like...like butchered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.07,1:04:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,村里的老女人一直画十字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old women in the village crossed themselves...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.87,1:04:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祈祷着疯狂 奇怪的祷词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and whispered crazy things, such strange things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.54,1:04:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼奉献
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.48,1:04:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有在最热的年份 才会发生这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in the hottest years this happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.15,1:04:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而今年也非常的热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this year, it grows hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.26,1:04:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始找到那些男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We begin finding our men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.46,1:04:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些被剥了皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found them sometimes without their skin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.05,1:04:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时更可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sometimes much, much worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.17,1:04:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼奉献的意思是...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.91,1:04:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼把男人当作他的战利品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means "the demon who makes trophies of man."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.80,1:05:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你下回要用什么作饵 芝士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you gonna try next, cheese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.70,1:05:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dutch. Dutch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.07,1:06:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.31,1:07:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捉到你了! 捉到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you, you mother! I got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.85,1:07:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来追你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.12,1:07:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克! 麦克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac! Mac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.32,1:07:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带他到直升机那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Ramirez to the chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.12,1:07:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.82,1:07:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 达奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.42,1:07:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去追麦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going after Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.82,1:07:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不像你的一贯作风 狄龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not your style, Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.32,1:07:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从你这学了些坏习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I picked up bad habits from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.93,1:07:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们快走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your people the hell out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.06,1:07:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能赢的 狄龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't win this, Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.63,1:07:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我可以报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I can get even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.23,1:07:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狄龙!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.64,1:07:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要叫那直升机等我和麦克回来就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hold onto that damn chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.55,1:07:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他伤得很重 少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's busted up pretty bad, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.49,1:07:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以捱得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can make it. I can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.99,1:07:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带走无线电 其它的都不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the radio. Forget the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.66,1:08:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.09,1:08:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧! 宾 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Poncho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.86,1:08:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.54,1:08:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高个子萨丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Long tall Sally"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.59,1:08:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她非常甜美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"she's built sweet!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.34,1:08:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她什么都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"She got everything that Uncle John need"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.76,1:08:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Oh, baby"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.10,1:08:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Baby"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.47,1:08:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我点快乐...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm gonna have me some fun"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.18,1:08:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我点快乐...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm gonna have me some fun"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.53,1:09:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.93,1:09:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.54,1:09:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.98,1:09:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.49,1:09:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.29,1:09:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.16,1:09:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它在那里 在那些树上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out there. Past them trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.00,1:09:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看得见吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.28,1:10:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.22,1:10:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.89,1:10:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.43,1:10:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们可以杀了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we can get this thing, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.20,1:10:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你慢慢爬过去接近它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work your way down there toward him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.40,1:10:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在上头逼近它后面 把它赶去你处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get in back of him, flush him toward you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.71,1:10:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我赶那杂种时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I flush the son of a bitch,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.01,1:10:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就杀了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you nail him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.41,1:10:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个血海深仇要报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a score to settle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.15,1:10:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都有仇要报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've both got scores to settle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.10,1:12:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快! 我们快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Quickly! Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.54,1:12:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要拿! 它没杀你是因为你没武装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. Leave it. It didn't kill you because you weren't armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.61,1:12:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对它来说太没趣味!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.15,1:12:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克! 麦克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac. Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.39,1:13:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.73,1:14:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.65,1:14:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.15,1:14:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利 我们走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.77,1:15:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我武器 给我武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.16,1:15:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别拿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.66,1:16:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑! 快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.05,1:16:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去直升机那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the chopper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.60,1:17:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.43,1:20:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它看不见我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.51,1:32:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,流血吧 杂种!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bleed, bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.82,1:35:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的丑得很!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one ugly motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.64,1:36:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这主意真差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.66,1:38:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 过来啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.46,1:38:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊 来啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.40,1:38:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来杀我 我在这里! 杀我啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Come on. Kill me! l'm here! Kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.37,1:38:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来杀我! 我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm here! kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.58,1:38:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来杀我! 我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Kill me! l'm here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.48,1:38:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 现在来杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, do it now! Kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.56,1:39:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you?{\r}
